{"id":1740754,"retrievedAt":"2026-07-31T13:17:05.932Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1740754,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Bulan Di Kota Langit","overview":"# Translation  The story tells of Munirah living with her four older brothers after their mother passed away while giving birth to Munirah. Munirah successfully continues her studies at a local college while her brothers each have various careers. Her eldest brother Amirul (Fezrul Khan) is a firefighter, Aqil (Fazren Rafi) is a lawyer, Afiq (Fahmy Reza) is a doctor, and Aathi (Fariz Redzwan) is a college student. The story depicts the harmony between Munirah and her siblings. In particular, the character of Abang Long is willing to sacrifice for his younger siblings. Before their mother passed away, Amirul was entrusted to take care of his siblings and he is strict with them. One day, Munirah receives a thesis topic that requires her to conduct research in Indonesia. Her brothers are worried about Munirah and after discussing, Aathif is asked to accompany Munirah to Indonesia. However, Aathif tries to convince Munirah to go to Indonesia alone.","popularity":0,"poster_path":"/vGF6wxbdExindLhkZsM5sh5mly5.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":303741,"logo_path":null,"name":"CMA Media Sdn Bhd","origin_country":""}],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2020-01-01","revenue":0,"runtime":0,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Bulan Di Kota Langit","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":6339510,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Nur Risteena Munim","original_name":"Nur Risteena Munim","popularity":0.8668,"profile_path":null,"cast_id":2,"character":"","credit_id":"6a6bfc8707085f612c893bed","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":2172069,"kno